<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50350" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĕlīnus
			lăcus</span></b>  or simply <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĕlī-nus</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a lake in the Sabine territories</i>, <i>between Reate and Interamnum</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 12,
				17, § 108</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 7,
				517</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rosea rura Velini,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 7, 712</span></i>
			.—It gave its name to <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĕlīna trĭbus</span></b> , <i>the people who dwelt around this lake</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Att.
				4, 15, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. Epit. 19 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">called also Velina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 6, 52</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Pers. 5, 73</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
